Except that is incredibly unlikely.  In practice, one MR source that is
not wielded and is not your own Quest artifact is nearly always
sufficient.  I have never had 1 such source stolen after waking Rodney,
and the one time I had it stolen I just killed the thief and put it
back on.  Having a second backup is suitable paranoia against bizarre
RNG cruelty, but being uncomfortable with less than three strikes me as
wasting resources that could be better spent averting other RNG
possibilities.  Just because something happened once doesn't mean it's
likely, and other more likely scenarios warrant your attention more.

